Link the system zita-resampler

Carla compiles its own copy of zita-resampler into zita-resampler.a. Link
-lzita-resampler instead, through ZITA_RESAMPLER_LIBS, everywhere the
archive was used. The headers keep their name, zita-resampler/resampler.h.

Upstream: not submitted (upstream bundles its dependencies)
Applies-to: all environments

